diff --git a/packages/pi-permission-system/README.md b/packages/pi-permission-system/README.md
index 4f7129b..76f8e12 100644
--- a/packages/pi-permission-system/README.md
+++ b/packages/pi-permission-system/README.md
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ Permission enforcement extension for the [Pi](https://pi.mariozechner.at/) codin
 - **Forwards prompts from subagents** — `ask` policies work even in non-UI execution contexts
 - **Broadcasts UI prompt events** — `permissions:ui_prompt` fires only when the permission system is about to invoke the active user-facing permission UI
 - **Shares approval transport** — other extensions can submit caller-owned choices through `PermissionsService.requestUserApproval()` while retaining their own policy and grant storage
+- **Supports approval-transport-only mode** — set `approvalTransportOnly` in the global config to publish and forward caller-owned prompts without registering tool, shell, path, or skill permission gates
 - **Native [`@gotgenes/pi-subagents`](https://github.com/gotgenes/pi-subagents) integration** — in-process child sessions register with the permission system automatically, enabling per-agent policy enforcement and `ask`-state forwarding to the parent UI without configuration
 
 ## Install
